  "modified": "Sat May 23 2026 17:30:21 GMT+0200 (South Africa Standard Time)",
  "html": "<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\">\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\">MECARD FOR TEAMS</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:26px\">Your whole team. One dashboard.</h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:26px\">Zero hassle.</h2>\n\n<p>Manage every staff member's digital business card from a single place — add people, order cards, keep everyone on-brand. No IT degree required.</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:20px\">Free to manage. No platform fees.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/manage/\">Set up your team</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-3-color has-ast-global-color-4-background-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"#mc-teams-how\">See how it works</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column main-img is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\">\n<div style=\"height:2px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/dashboard-1024x662-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-79512\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:46px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\">WHAT YOU GET</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">Everything you need. Nothing you don't.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns g-4 mc-reveal is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-users\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Everyone in one place</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Manage all your team members, their profiles, physical cards, and company branches from a single dashboard. No more chasing people for updated job titles.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-rotate\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Reassign cards instantly</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">When someone leaves, archive their profile and reassign their NFC card to the replacement. No reprinting, no waste, no waiting weeks.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-palette\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">On-brand, every time</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Set your company's Pro profile look and feel centrally — logo, colours, layout. Every card stays consistent without relying on individuals.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns g-4 mc-reveal is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Bulk-order cards</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Order classic or custom NFC cards in a few clicks. Cards ship together, each pre-linked to the right profile.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-qrcode\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">QR codes for everything</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Printable QR codes for reception desks, conference posters, trade show banners, or email footers. Each one always up to date.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-hand-pointer\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">No training manual needed</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Built for the person who actually does the work — not a developer. If you can use a spreadsheet, you can run this.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\">WHO IT'S FOR</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">Built for the people who actually manage business cards</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns g-4 mc-reveal is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-clipboard-list\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Office managers</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\"><em>\"I just need to get 12 new starters set up before Monday.\"</em></p>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Add profiles in bulk, order their cards, and have everything ready before they walk in the door.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-gears\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Ops &amp; admin leads</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\"><em>\"Someone left last week and their card is still floating around.\"</em></p>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Archive leavers instantly. Reassign their physical card to the new hire. The profile follows the person, not the plastic.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns g-4 mc-reveal is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-briefcase\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Business owners</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\"><em>\"I don't have time to manage this. I just want it to work.\"</em></p>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Set it up once. Your brand stays locked in. Staff can update their own contact details if you let them — the look and feel stays consistent.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chart-line\"></i></div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Sales managers</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\"><em>\"I want to know my team is actually using these.\"</em></p>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Every card tap is tracked. See which reps are sharing and where your team's best connections are coming from.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\" id=\"mc-teams-how\">HOW IT WORKS</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">Up and running in three steps</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns g-4 mc-reveal is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\">1</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Create your team</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Sign up and add your company details — name, logo, brand colours. This becomes the template for every team member's profile.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\">2</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Add your people</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Add team members one by one or in bulk. Fill in their details, or invite them to complete their own profiles. The brand stays locked either way.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column jumbotron is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"mc-step-num\">3</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mc-step-title\">Order cards &amp; go</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mc-step-desc\">Order NFC cards for the team in one go. Each card links to the right profile. Recipients save your team's details with one tap.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\">PRICING</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Simple. No platform fees.</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">No contracts. Add or remove people anytime.</p>\n\n<div class=\"row g-4 justify-content-center mc-reveal\">\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"mc-price-card\">\n<div class=\"mc-tier-name\">Teams dashboard</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-baseline gap-1 mb-1\"><span class=\"mc-price\">Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"mc-price-sub\">Manage your whole team at no cost</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"mc-price-card\">\n<div class=\"mc-tier-name\">Profile upgrade per person</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-baseline gap-1 mb-1\"><span class=\"mc-price\">R199</span></div>\n<div class=\"mc-price-sub\">Once-off · Pro profile with company branding</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"mc-price-card\">\n<div class=\"mc-tier-name\">NFC cards</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex align-items-baseline gap-1 mb-1\"><span class=\"mc-price\">From R299</span></div>\n<div class=\"mc-price-sub\">Once-off · Classic or custom design</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"margin-top:24px;font-size:0.9rem\">Bundles available — card + Pro profile + phone tag from R499.</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:52px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:52px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-link-color has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color\">FAQ</h6>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Questions about Teams</h2>\n\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion\" style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong>Q: Is there a minimum team size?</strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>No. Whether you have 3 people or 300, Teams works the same way. Though if it's just you, the individual MeCard is probably a better fit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong><strong>Q: Can staff edit their own profiles?</strong></strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>You choose. Lock profiles so only admins can edit, or allow team members to update their own contact details while keeping brand elements — logo, colours, layout — centrally controlled.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong><strong><strong>Q: Do I need to buy cards for everyone?</strong></strong></strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>No. Digital profiles work on their own — QR codes, WhatsApp sharing, link sharing. The NFC card is an add-on for people who want the physical tap-to-share experience.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong><strong><strong><strong>Q: What happens when someone leaves?</strong></strong></strong></strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>Archive their profile with one click. Their digital profile goes offline, and you can reassign their physical NFC card to a new team member. No reprinting needed — the card just points to the new person's profile.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong>Q: Can I manage multiple branches or offices?</strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>Yes. Create separate company branches within your team, each with their own branding if needed. Team members are grouped by branch.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading has-medium-font-size\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\"><strong><strong>Q: How is this different from individual MeCard?</strong></strong></span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\" hidden>\n<p>Individual MeCard is for one person managing their own profile. Teams adds a management layer on top — create and control profiles for other people, enforce branding, order cards in bulk, and reassign cards when staff change. The profiles themselves work the same way.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity\"/>\n\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<section class=\"mc-section-sm\">\n  <div class=\"container mc-reveal\">\n    <div class=\"mc-cta-banner text-center text-lg-start\">\n      <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n          <h2 class=\"mc-cta-heading\">Stop chasing people for business card updates.</h2>\n          <p class=\"mc-cta-text mb-4 mb-lg-0\">\n            Set up your team dashboard in five minutes. Add your first team member today.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-5 text-lg-end text-center\">\n          <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-content-lg-end justify-content-center\">\n            <a href=\"/sign-up/?for=teams\" class=\"mc-btn mc-btn-primary mc-btn-lg\">Set up your team</a>\n            <a href=\"/contact-us/\" class=\"mc-btn mc-btn-outline mc-btn-lg\">Talk to us first <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-right ms-1\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
}
